/-!
# Part 88, frozen definitions: a sharper general-degree threshold for Theorem 4 (uniform `D`)

Role: `delegations/statements/p88-spec.md`. This file holds definitions and `Prop`-valued interface
statements only. Do not edit this file. Do not use `sorry`, `native_decide` or `axiom`.

Changes against Part 84:
* sphere moments: `E (n p₄)^j ≤ B^j`, `B` near `3` (`MomB`), in place of `(4j−1)!!`;
* the scale defect through Part 81's `kap_delta_le` (`PtIface88`, `tauF`), not through `d · p₄`;
* the Gaussian model on a scale window `|lam² − 1| ≤ w/n`, with one level `L` for every scale and
  a drift bound for the centre `Vb` (`GM88`);
* the sphere step by a semicircle average over the scale and the Christoffel function of the
  Chebyshev polynomials of the second kind (`ChrisIface`, `SemiStep`), in place of Lemma R+.
-/

namespace BstLean.Part88

open MeasureTheory
open scoped ENNReal
open BstLean.Part29 (stdGauss uniformSphere)
open BstLean.Part36 (CoefIdxD DD unitOfD mapMD)
open BstLean.Part41 (Mono)
